			"notes": "# Copper Extension - 1.5.0\n## Major Features\n- **Add Copper Armor & Tools for each oxidation stages**\n- **Oxidation, Waxing & Scraping are now fully data driven** *(more info on the [wiki](https://killarexe.github.io/Copper-Extension-wiki/datapacks/)).*\n- **Add a new feature, Lightning Effects**, which able the player to get potion effects when he's struck by lightning *(more info on the [wiki](https://killarexe.github.io/Copper-Extension-wiki/mechanics/lightning_effects/)).*\n## Minor changes\n- **Copper base oxidation chance is now at 0.004% chance/item/s** so a single copper ingot will oxidize at maximum every 7 hours. *(You can still change with the `copperOxidationChance` gamerule)*\n- Fixes bugs\n- Refactor the mod's code to be cleaner and more readable\n## Other things\n- **Created a brand new [wiki](https://killarexe.github.io/Copper-Extension-wiki/) to learn all about this mod!**\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Killarexe/Copper-Extension/compare/1.4.7...1.5.0"
